            "reviewBody": "I made as directed but took other's advice and added more spice and also added sugar. I tasted the batter until it tasted right and then cooked it. OH!! I almost forgot! I added about 1/2 tsp of baking powder. I fried them\nIn peanut oil at about 375 and they puffed up beautifully and were DELISH!!",
